    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1727711656\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Reality patrol is third person stealth-action game. Travel through time to different eras to protect history from absurd villains.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/d8b707e5c4162fb339a02ae31f1816e0.poster.avif?t=1727711656\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/d8b707e5c4162fb339a02ae31f1816e0.webm?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/d8b707e5c4162fb339a02ae31f1816e0.mp4?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your sci-fi gadgets and skills to complete your assignment with maximum effectiveness.\tTry to work quietly and cleanly so as not to change human history.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/7404496716f6566848cebf5c8ac0b82b.poster.avif?t=1727711656\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/7404496716f6566848cebf5c8ac0b82b.webm?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/7404496716f6566848cebf5c8ac0b82b.mp4?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are multiple ways to complete your objective.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/3bc40d4cf8056b1d03391ad0482138ee.poster.avif?t=1727711656\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/3bc40d4cf8056b1d03391ad0482138ee.webm?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/3bc40d4cf8056b1d03391ad0482138ee.mp4?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
