.mp4?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>There are multiple ways to complete your objective.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/3bc40d4cf8056b1d03391ad0482138ee.poster.avif?t=1727711656\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/3bc40d4cf8056b1d03391ad0482138ee.webm?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586790/extras/3bc40d4cf8056b1d03391ad0482138ee.mp4?t=1727711656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
